    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d399">

                <pb facs="0892" n="844" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg844"/>

                <head>Mr. Van Valkenburgh to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 125.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Yokohama,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-11-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 25, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to inform you that
                    yesterday a procession of Japanese, said to contain the Mikado, passed through
                    Kanagawa on its way to Yedo. No one being favored with a special invitation, I
                    did not go to see it. The eyes of many were strained to catch a glimpse of the
                    Mikado, but in the imperial sedan chair no occupant could be discerned. It is
                    generally believed, however, that this distinguished personage was actually
                    present.</p>
                <pb facs="0893" n="845" xml:id="pg845"/>
                <p>I transmit inclosure No. 1, a description of the procession from one of the local
                    papers.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, very respectfully, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>R. B. VAN VALKENBURGH.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington,</hi> D. <hi
                            rendition="#italic">C</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d399-a1.xml" xpointer="d399-a1"/>
            </div>
